

Your performance in the Stacks Builder Challenges is based on multiple activity signals, including:

On-chain activity on the Stacks network (transactions, deployed contracts, interactions).

Public contributions such as GitHub commits, repositories, or open-source project updates.

Additional Talent Protocol metrics such as builder score, creator score, verified identity, and human activity signals.

The leaderboard displays information like creator earnings, collectors, tokens created, and overall volume — giving visibility to your growth and contributions.
